OL,1,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,2,EFeedback from a first-batch MEGA65     
OL,3,Eowner: disappointed                    
OL,5,CAntwort:  BGoDot                       
OL,6,CComments: B32                          
OL,7,F                                       
OL,8,F( )                                    
OL,10,FReally? Ok, my bad, sorry...           
OL,12,FArndt                                  
OL,14,CErster Beitrag:                        
OL,16,GHi, I recently learned about the       
OL,17,GVIXEN-32 core, so I got my MEGA65 out  
OL,18,Gof its box to try it, excited to       
OL,19,Gfinally try something impressive on my 
OL,20,GMegs65. It doesn't work. After some    
OL,21,Gdigging, I understand why: the core    
OL,22,Gneeds the 64 MB SDRAM chip that only   
OL,23,Gexists on the newer R4/R6 mainboards.  
OL,24,D]FForum64.de RSS feed            (1/3) 
FL,0,0,0,0,0,100
PN,11302
SC,0002
PS,C200
CT,15,T
OL,0,         GFORUM64   GDi 24 Nov F20:22:08
OL,1,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GMy machine, from the first public      
OL,4,Gbatch, has an R3A board, which doesn't 
OL,5,Ghave it. The only way to run VIXEN-32  
OL,6,Gis to buy a new mainboard.well I       
OL,7,Gthought, no worries, they certainly    
OL,8,Gexist some upgrade program             
OL,10,GI asked Trenz whether any replacement  
OL,11,Gor trade-in offer existed for          
OL,12,Gearly-batch owners. Their answer: no   
OL,13,Gexchange program, no trade-in credit,  
OL,14,Gno discount. The R6 mainboard          
OL,15,G(TE0765-07-B) can be bought separately 
OL,16,G(about US$528 incl. VAT when I checked,
OL,17,Gout of stock at the time), and I can   
OL,18,Gkeep my old board. When I voiced my    
OL,19,Gdisappointment, I was simply pointed to
OL,20,Gthis forum, with none of my points     
OL,21,Gaddressed.                             
OL,23,GThis comes on top of two other problems
OL,24,D]FForum64.de RSS feed            (2/3) 
